{"kind":"table","sheet":"Changes to the template","address":"A1:A31","rows":31,"cols":1,"values":[["\n⚠️ Important! This Catalog template has changed."],[null],["What is changing and why?"],["In order to improve the shopping experience for Customers, we are changing how we collect, categorize and display your listing data. This includes the types of data that are required, conditionally required, and optional."],[null],["What types of changes will I see?"],["1. The Price & Quantity template will be generated based on your account marketplace and your customer segments. You will see updated labels for your offer attributes. Amazon has updated the grouping of 'Offer' attributes to improve multi-offer listing capability for those catering to more than one customer segment (like Sell on Amazon, Amazon Business, Haul, etc)."],["If you are authorized to sell through Amazon Business, you will see offer attributes to set prices for that intended customer segment. You will see \"Sell on Amazon\" (to set standard customer prices) and \"Amazon Business\" (to set discounted business price) Offer attributes. In this new template, the business price is called as 'Your Price\" under 'Offer - Amazon Business (B2B)'. Quantity Discount attributes are also now available within the Offer attributes group to simplify setting of quantity discounts for business offers."],["If you are authorized to sell through Amazon Haul, you will see offer attributes to set prices for that intended customer segment. You will see \"Sell on Amazon\" (to set standard customer prices) and \"Haul\" (to set prices in low-cost store) Offer attributes."],["2. The Offer attributes group include fulfillment availability attributes like Fulfillment Channel, Quantity, etc. SKU is the only required column of the template, with all other columns being optional or conditionally required. Fulfillment Channel will need to be provided to change Quantity, Handling Time, Restock Date, and Inventory Always Available attributes."],["3. You can delete your existing offers using this template by providing a SKU and setting \"Your Price\" column of the particular customer segment of the offer to \"Delete Offer\" dropdown value instead of a numerical value."],[null],["How will this affect me right now?"],["You may continue to use the old templates until further notice. We will notify 30 days before the date from which you will no longer be able to upload the old templates to create or update listings."],[null],["How will I know that I am generating the new template?"],["Download a template using the Add Products page as usual. We will let you know that you are generating a new template through a message alert before you generate the template."],[null],["What can I do to prepare for the change?"],["Download the new templates. Review the changes to the attributes so you know what to expect. Provide all new required attributes for all your listings. We recommend making these changes sooner to take advantage of additional features such as improved dropdown and conditional requirement highlights."],[null],[null],[null],[null],[null],[null],[null],[null],[null],[null],["`"]]}
